  <div class="prose prose-lg mt-6 max-w-none">
    <h2>Information according to § 5 DDG</h2>
    <p>Michael Konjevic<br />Hoffeldstraße 156<br />70597 Stuttgart<br />Germany</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
    <h2>Responsible for content according to § 18 Abs. 2 MStV</h2>
    <p>Michael Konjevic, address as above.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
